# Ruleset: China CDN
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# Mainland content hosts. Keep large objects on the local last mile. ctlcdn.cn and ctadns.cn are China Telecom's CDN zones; NetEase Cloud Music streams through them under names like m701.music.126.net.ctlcdn.cn (420 MB in the 14 days to 2026-11-02).

